flowchart TD
    A[Appointment Service] -->|local transaction: appointment + AppointmentCreated| DB1[(appointment.db)]
    DB1 --> O[Outbox: PENDING to PUBLISHED]
    O -->|retryable publication| B[Simulated Message Broker]
    B -->|AppointmentCreated| M[Medical Consultation Service]
    M --> DB2[(medical_consultation.db)]
    DB2 -->|success: consultation + processed_events| S[Saga succeeds]
    M -->|injected failure; transaction rolls back| F[Failure path]
    F --> C[Compensation: AppointmentCancelled]
    C -->|appointment_id| B
    B -->|AppointmentCancelled| A
    A -->|set status CANCELLED| DB1
